      {
        "id": "E0",
        "kind": "feed",
        "text": "Open a pull request and get back to building. Claude can now review pull requests, fix them, and approve the ones that a team's policy allows.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-claude-ship",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "• • • • • • • • • • Introducing Claude Ship | Claude by Anthropic • • •",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-claude-ship",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "On the Claude Code team, Claude writes most of our code , and we wanted everything after the PR to move that fast too.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-claude-ship",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "That's why we built Claude Ship , available today in beta.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-claude-ship",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Eligible Claude Enterprise organizations can claim at least $10,000 in Claude Ship credits to use within 30 days of claiming.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-claude-ship",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "How Claude Ship works: review, fix, and approve",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-claude-ship",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude Ship is made up of Code Review , which is already generally available, and two new agents in beta: PR Steward and Claude Approvals.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-claude-ship",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "On the Claude Code team, where Claude's review is one layer of a broader process, merged PRs more than doubled from June to September while the share reverted fell by more than 40%.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-claude-ship",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Developers can try Claude Ship on their own pull requests with the new /ship command in Claude Code.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-claude-ship",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For example, a product manager on the Claude Code team can now read a piece of feedback, talk through ideas and tradeoffs with Claude Tag, have it open a PR, and move on to the next thing while Claude Ship takes it through review, fixes, and an approval decision.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-claude-ship",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude Ship is available on Claude Team and Enterprise plans for repositories on GitHub.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-claude-ship",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Claude Ship is not available to organizations with Zero Data Retention, the HIPAA configuration, or customer-managed encryption keys.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-claude-ship",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.211Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Developers can update Claude Code and run /ship on their next change. /ship is rolling out in Claude Code and the desktop app starting today.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://claude.com/resources/articles/introducing-claude-ship",
        "source": "Claude (claude.com articles)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-23T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-23T22:02:25.211Z"
      }
